<title>UK: EDF sets 100 million stg three-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>EDF sets 100 million stg three-year Eurobond.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, May 6 (Reuter) The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ELECTRICITE DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.40	MATURITY    22.MAY/00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE    20.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5	 SALE LIMITS US/GB/JP/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
